esale List Scanning</h3><p class="pgx-1">Upload any wholesale list (CSV/XLSX). Ecom Circles matches items to marketplace listings, calculates profit automatically, and shows you exactly which items to buy.</p></div><div class="pgx-58"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Dynamic Repricing</h3><p class="pgx-1">SourceDart tracks prices. Ecom Circles reprices automatically. Set rules (undercut Buy Box by 5%, match competitor, etc.), and Ecom Circles handles pricing 24/7.</p></div><div class="pgx-58"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Automatic Inventory Sync</h3><p class="pgx-1">List one SKU across Amazon, Walmart, and Mirakl. Ecom Circles syncs stock automatically. No overselling. No manual updates.</p></div><div class="pgx-58"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Order Management &amp; 3PL</h3><p class="pgx-1">Ecom Circles manages orders, shipping labels, 3PL prepayment, and returns. SourceDart doesn&#x27;t touch fulfillment.</p></div><div class="pgx-58"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Monthly Updates &amp; Growth</h3><p class="pgx-1">Ecom Circles ships new features every month (repricer improvements, new marketplace connectors, analytics). SourceDart is mature and stable but less innovative.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="pgx-49 bg-shades"><div class="pgx-42"><h2 class="pgx-311 font-satoshi">When SourceDart Makes Sense</h2><div class="pgx-24"><div class="pgx-312"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Multi-Retailer Reverse Sourcing Focus</h3><p class="pgx-1">SourceDart is the best-in-class tool. It monitors eBay, Costco, Best Buy, Target, and other retailers that Ecom Circles doesn&#x27;t yet cover. If reverse sourcing across 8+ retailers is your main workflow, use SourceDart.</p></div><div class="pgx-312"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Price Tracking &amp; Competitive Intelligence</h3><p class="pgx-1">SourceDart&#x27;s price history and seller tracking are strong. If your main job is tracking competitor pricing and inventory, SourceDart alone might suffice.</p></div><div class="pgx-312"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Mobile-First Research</h3><p class="pgx-1">SourceDart&#x27;s mobile app is excellent for on-the-go sourcing. Ecom Circles&#x27; mobile app exists but is new. If mobile sourcing is critical, SourceDart wins.</p></div><div class="pgx-312"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Budget Conscious (Pure Research)</h3><p class="pgx-1">At $29.95/mo, SourceDart is affordable for research-only. If you&#x27;re just scouting products and don&#x27;t need order/inventory management yet, SourceDart is enough.</p></div><div class="pgx-312"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Walmart Sourcing Specialist</h3><p class="pgx-1">SourceDart markets itself as #1 for Walmart sourcing and has excellent data on Walmart. If Walmart is 80% of your business, SourceDart is a strong choice.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="pgx-57 bg-shades"><div class="pgx-34"><h2 class="pgx-51 font-satoshi">The Best Strategy: Use Both</h2><div class="pgx-765"><p class="pgx-524">Smart sellers use SourceDart for research (reverse sourcing, price tracking, competitor monitoring) and Ecom Circles for operations (wholesale scanning, repricing, inventory, orders, 3PL). SourceDart answers &quot;Should I buy this product?&quot; and &quot;What&#x27;s the market?&quot;. Ecom Circles answers &quot;How do I buy, price, and ship it at scale?&quot;.</p><p class="pgx-766">The workflows complement perfectly: Research with SourceDart → Export findings as CSV → Scan in Ecom Circles → Set repricing rules → Manage inventory and orders in Ecom Circles. Zero overlap, maximum efficiency.</p></div></div></section><section class="pgx-49 bg-shades"><div class="pgx-42"><h2 class="pgx-311 font-satoshi">SourceDart vs Ecom Circles FAQs</h2><div><div><div class="pg-faq__item"><button class="pg-faq__btn"><span class="pg-faq__q">Can I use SourceDart and Ecom Circles together?</span><span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down pg-faq__chev" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="pg-faq__item"><button class="pg-faq__btn"><span class="pg-faq__q">Why would I choose SourceDart over Ecom Circles?</span><span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down pg-faq__chev" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="pg-faq__item"><button class="pg-faq__btn"><span class="pg-faq__q">Why would I choose Ecom Circles over SourceDart?</span><span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down pg-faq__chev" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="pg-faq__item"><button class="pg-faq__btn"><span class="pg-faq__q">Does Ecom Circles include reverse sourcing like SourceDart?</span><span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down pg-faq__chev" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="pg-faq__item"><button class="pg-faq__btn"><span class="pg-faq__q">How does Ecom Circles&#x27; sourcing compare to SourceDart?</span><span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down pg-faq__chev" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></